---
const REPO = 'nimto/d4cute';
const REPO_ID = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GISCUS_REPO_ID || 'PLACEHOLDER';
const CATEGORY = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GISCUS_CATEGORY || 'Comments';
const CATEGORY_ID = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GISCUS_CATEGORY_ID || 'PLACEHOLDER';
const isPlaceholder = REPO_ID === 'PLACEHOLDER' || CATEGORY_ID === 'PLACEHOLDER';

const rawPath = Astro.url.pathname.replace(/^\/d4cute/, '') || '/';
const term = rawPath.endsWith('/') ? rawPath : `${rawPath}/`;
---

<div class="comments-wrapper" id="page-comments">
  <h2>💬 댓글</h2>

  <details class="comments-howto">
    <summary>댓글 수정·삭제 방법 (펼쳐 보기)</summary>
    <div class="comments-howto-body">
      <p><strong>본인 댓글</strong> — 작성한 댓글 오른쪽 위 <code>···</code> (더보기) 아이콘 → <code>Edit</code> (수정) 또는 <code>Delete</code> (삭제). GitHub 로그인 상태에서만 보입니다.</p>
      <p><strong>관리자 모더레이션</strong> — 부적절한 댓글 발견 시 우측 <code>···</code> 메뉴의 <code>Report</code> 사용. 사이트 관리자 (<code>@nimto</code>) 가 검토 후 GitHub Discussions에서 직접 삭제·잠금 처리합니다.</p>
      <p><strong>익명 작성</strong> — Giscus는 GitHub 계정이 필요합니다. 익명 댓글은 지원하지 않습니다.</p>
    </div>
  </details>

  {isPlaceholder ? (
    <div class="comments-placeholder">
      <strong>Giscus 댓글 위젯 비활성화 상태</strong>
      <p>
        <code>PUBLIC_GISCUS_REPO_ID</code>, <code>PUBLIC_GISCUS_CATEGORY_ID</code> 환경 변수가 설정되지 않았습니다.
        활성화 절차는 README의 "Giscus 설정" 섹션을 참고합니다.
      </p>
    </div>
  ) : (
    <script
      is:inline
      src="https://giscus.app/client.js"
      data-repo={REPO}
      data-repo-id={REPO_ID}
      data-category={CATEGORY}
      data-category-id={CATEGORY_ID}
      data-mapping="specific"
      data-term={term}
      data-strict="1"
      data-reactions-enabled="1"
      data-emit-metadata="0"
      data-input-position="top"
      data-theme="dark_dimmed"
      data-lang="ko"
      data-loading="lazy"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      async
    ></script>
  )}
</div>

<style>
  .comments-wrapper {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }
  .comments-wrapper h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .comments-placeholder {
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
    border: 1px dashed var(--sl-color-gray-4);
    padding: 1rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
  .comments-howto {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-6, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03));
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .comments-howto summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--d4-gold, #eac333);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    list-style: none;
    user-select: none;
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }
  .comments-howto summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .comments-howto summary::before {
    content: '▶';
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.7em;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .comments-howto[open] summary::before { transform: rotate(90deg); }
  .comments-howto summary:hover {
    background: rgba(234, 195, 51, 0.08);
  }
  .comments-howto-body {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--sl-color-text);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
  }
  .comments-howto-body p { margin: 0.4rem 0; }
  .comments-howto-body code {
    background: rgba(234, 195, 51, 0.12);
    color: var(--d4-gold, #eac333);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 0.92em;
  }
  [data-theme='light'] .comments-howto-body code {
    background: rgba(234, 195, 51, 0.22);
    color: #8a6a00;
  }
</style>
